# Reports

All reports: filter by **organization**; format for easy **copy/paste into email**.

## Weekly (`/reports/weekly`)

- Inputs: Organization + week (Sunday–Saturday)
- Per meeting: day + class type, attendee count, no-shows (unexpected absences); optional expected absences
- Example tone: `Monday Zumba: 24 people attending` / `No shows: Smith, John; Doe, Jane`

## End of Session (`/reports/end-of-session`)

- Inputs: Organization + Session (optional “show closed sessions”)
- Per class: day + type, then `date (count), date (count), …`

## Residency (`/reports/residency`)

- Inputs: Organization + Session (optional closed sessions)
- Per class: Rochester resident vs non-resident aggregate counts across the session

## Cumulative (`/reports/cumulative`)

- Spec still open — define before implementing new behavior
